WEBVTT

00:23.406 --> 00:27.365
Now you will take my place as the Sakurazukamori.

00:28.912 --> 00:33.406
And the next Sakurazukamori will be the one who kills you.

00:34.885 --> 00:36.853
Who will be killing me?

00:38.989 --> 00:39.956
The one...

00:40.991 --> 00:42.754
...that you love the most.

00:44.027 --> 00:46.621
I won't ever be able to love anyone.

00:48.832 --> 00:51.096
That's what I had thought, too.

00:52.536 --> 00:54.333
Before I met you.

00:58.675 --> 00:59.903
Farewell...

01:00.944 --> 01:02.070
...Seishirou.

01:08.985 --> 01:10.748
Farewell...

01:10.821 --> 01:11.947
...Mother.

01:14.658 --> 01:18.602
Episode 16
Slaughter

01:29.573 --> 01:31.131
If you want to kill me...

01:32.175 --> 01:33.608
...come at full strength.

01:37.814 --> 01:39.372
A Dragon of Heaven...

01:40.383 --> 01:42.180
Here to save Kamui.

01:45.922 --> 01:50.018
The fastest way out of a Barrier is to kill the one who made it.

02:48.118 --> 02:49.551
I see.

02:49.619 --> 02:51.416
You had made such a trap.

02:53.723 --> 02:56.385
The resemblance... Impossible!

02:56.459 --> 02:59.656
If you don't concentrate, your meditation will be ruined...

02:59.729 --> 03:00.696
...Subaru.

03:38.468 --> 03:39.799
Why do you...

03:40.837 --> 03:42.805
Seishirou...

03:46.276 --> 03:48.210
Why do I look like him?

03:51.581 --> 03:54.072
Because you wished it so.

04:23.079 --> 04:25.240
You saw it all, right?

04:25.315 --> 04:26.976
You realized?

04:28.284 --> 04:32.448
That Dragon of Heaven seems to have ties with you.

04:32.522 --> 04:33.580
Yes.

04:33.656 --> 04:36.386
He wished for the loss of his right eye...

04:37.427 --> 04:38.621
...like you.

04:40.296 --> 04:43.823
But only you can grant his true wish.

04:45.702 --> 04:47.294
His true wish...

04:48.338 --> 04:50.932
...is something different
from what you're thinking.

04:55.845 --> 04:57.278
His true wish?

05:09.492 --> 05:11.153
Poor Mr. Saiki...

05:12.195 --> 05:13.594
Subaru, too...

05:16.299 --> 05:18.199
The princess must be grieving, too.

05:18.268 --> 05:19.292
What about Mr. Aoki?

05:19.869 --> 05:23.168
He said he was going to look for Dragons of Earth.

05:23.239 --> 05:25.173
Guess he can't take it without moving.

05:39.055 --> 05:41.353
You stayed like that the entire time?

05:41.424 --> 05:44.552
Because you did so for me before, Subaru.

05:45.595 --> 05:46.721
I'm all right.

05:48.465 --> 05:49.830
I'm sorry.

05:49.899 --> 05:52.595
It's nothing you should apologize for.

05:52.669 --> 05:54.466
This is what I wished.

06:01.678 --> 06:02.940
How's he doing?

06:05.515 --> 06:09.007
They said Subaru will never regain sight in his right eye.

06:11.988 --> 06:13.819
It's my fault.

06:13.890 --> 06:15.414
With Kotori...

06:15.492 --> 06:16.618
And Saiki...

06:17.894 --> 06:20.624
I was at their sides but couldn't do anything.

06:21.998 --> 06:23.625
It's not your fault, Kamui.

06:23.700 --> 06:25.600
I couldn't do anything, either.

06:25.668 --> 06:26.930
Me, too.

06:27.003 --> 06:28.834
I couldn't be of any help.

06:28.905 --> 06:30.133
Yes.

06:30.206 --> 06:31.935
I didn't make it in time, either.

06:33.309 --> 06:34.708
I don't need pity.

06:38.748 --> 06:39.874
Kamui...

06:43.386 --> 06:45.149
Leave him alone for now.

06:46.356 --> 06:48.085
Kamui's hurt, too.

06:48.158 --> 06:49.216
He needs rest.

06:50.260 --> 06:51.386
Besides...

06:51.461 --> 06:54.487
...we're looking for Dragons of Earth with Mr. Aoki.

06:54.564 --> 06:55.758
The Dragons of Earth?

06:55.832 --> 06:56.992
Yeah.

06:57.066 --> 06:59.626
The princess seems to be in a rut...

06:59.702 --> 07:02.603
She didn't see this happen in her dream, right?

07:02.672 --> 07:06.540
We don't know where a Dragon of Earth will appear next.

07:06.609 --> 07:09.578
But bumming around isn't good.

07:09.646 --> 07:11.375
We have to do what we can.

07:12.415 --> 07:13.541
Right!

07:13.616 --> 07:14.810
That's true.

07:14.884 --> 07:17.682
I don't want to regret not doing anything.

07:22.926 --> 07:24.291
All right!

07:24.360 --> 07:27.022
We're gonna scour all of Tokyo!

07:33.603 --> 07:37.801
I once thought that I wanted to lose sight in this right eye.

07:39.509 --> 07:40.999
But why did he...

07:42.645 --> 07:45.341
Because you wished it so.

07:47.317 --> 07:50.809
How did the Kamui of the Dragons of Earth know?

07:54.457 --> 07:56.652
Does he know my true wish?

08:02.098 --> 08:03.395
Princess.

08:03.466 --> 08:06.299
The leader of the Sumeragis is here to see you.

08:11.641 --> 08:13.734
Are your wounds all right now?

08:13.810 --> 08:16.040
I'm sorry to have worried you.

08:16.112 --> 08:18.080
I apologize.

08:18.147 --> 08:20.615
So much danger in you getting hurt...

08:20.683 --> 08:23.675
Yet I couldn't see it in my dream.

08:24.754 --> 08:25.982
It's not your fault.

08:27.023 --> 08:29.287
I couldn't save Saiki, either.

08:30.326 --> 08:32.590
I should be the one to apologize.

08:33.830 --> 08:35.525
Kamui and the others?

08:35.598 --> 08:39.261
Because I can't see the Dragons of Earth in my dreams...

08:39.335 --> 08:41.860
...they are doing their best to look for them.

08:43.373 --> 08:44.863
I'll go help, too.

08:47.744 --> 08:48.870
What's the matter?

08:50.747 --> 08:52.874
I just had a dream...

08:55.351 --> 08:58.445
I saw the next Barrier to be broken.

08:58.521 --> 08:59.488
That is?

09:01.758 --> 09:04.022
The bridge that spans Tokyo Bay...

09:05.328 --> 09:07.922
There, one of the Dragons of Earth...

09:07.997 --> 09:09.396
The Sakurazukamori.

09:13.269 --> 09:15.169
I will go.

09:15.238 --> 09:16.728
By yourself?

09:17.907 --> 09:21.070
I might not make it in time if I wait for the others.

09:23.146 --> 09:24.909
Please...

09:24.981 --> 09:26.915
Please do be careful.

09:31.421 --> 09:32.911
Please...

09:32.989 --> 09:34.217
...be careful.

10:24.240 --> 10:26.731
We finally meet again, Subaru.

10:28.745 --> 10:31.179
You haven't changed one bit.

10:32.215 --> 10:34.183
As adorable as always.

10:58.841 --> 11:00.138
Barrier Field.

11:06.048 --> 11:07.174
Subaru...

12:33.870 --> 12:36.202
You don't have to use spells like this.

12:36.272 --> 12:38.240
I've been trapped by the cherries...

12:39.275 --> 12:40.640
Since that day.

12:41.677 --> 12:44.840
The Kamui of the Dragons of Earth told me.

12:44.914 --> 12:46.882
That I am the only one...

12:48.484 --> 12:50.577
...who can grant your true wish.

12:53.389 --> 12:57.416
But that it was different from what I've been thinking.

12:58.995 --> 13:02.590
Isn't your wish to kill me?

13:05.701 --> 13:06.668
It is not.

13:27.523 --> 13:30.151
Subaru's Barrier is dissolving?

13:56.986 --> 13:58.613
W-Why?

14:01.290 --> 14:02.951
The last spell...

14:03.993 --> 14:05.756
...cast by your sister...

14:06.963 --> 14:08.988
...using her life.

14:12.835 --> 14:15.929
I want Subaru to live on.

14:16.005 --> 14:18.405
I know it's selfish of me.

14:18.474 --> 14:20.772
He's as good as dead from what happened...

14:20.843 --> 14:22.708
...yet I want him to live on.

14:22.778 --> 14:25.144
I know that's arrogant.

14:25.214 --> 14:26.977
But still...

14:27.049 --> 14:29.813
...I want Subaru and you to live on.

14:31.020 --> 14:32.954
Why me as well?

14:33.022 --> 14:34.922
I hurt Subaru...

14:34.991 --> 14:36.390
...and I'm killing you.

14:37.426 --> 14:40.122
Yeah, that's true...

14:40.196 --> 14:43.427
But I don't want you to also die, after all.

14:44.467 --> 14:47.368
No matter how bad you are, even if you're a killer...

14:47.436 --> 14:50.530
In the end, I'm rather fond of you.

14:52.274 --> 14:55.038
Subaru is the only one that can kill you.

14:55.111 --> 14:58.308
And you're the only one that can kill Subaru.

14:58.381 --> 15:02.545
So with the last of my powers, I'm going to cast a spell.

15:03.586 --> 15:09.616
If you try to kill Subaru in the same way you kill me...

15:09.692 --> 15:12.559
...that attack will bounce right back at you.

15:13.596 --> 15:18.192
Why are you telling me about the spell you're using your life to cast?

15:18.267 --> 15:20.758
It doesn't mean anything if I don't.

15:20.836 --> 15:23.430
Let me trust you this one, last time.

15:23.506 --> 15:27.169
So that this spell will never be invoked.

15:28.477 --> 15:31.674
I'm not someone that can gain your trust.

15:33.582 --> 15:34.549
I know.

15:35.584 --> 15:37.518
But I want to believe in you.

15:37.586 --> 15:39.019
Don't forget that.

15:40.389 --> 15:43.620
There are sins you can never repent for...

15:43.693 --> 15:47.424
...but nobody's ever not allowed to love someone.

15:47.496 --> 15:48.554
Sei.

15:58.407 --> 15:59.374
That day...

16:00.376 --> 16:04.972
Hokuto was the one who was stabbed in the heart like this.

16:05.047 --> 16:09.814
You killed my sister and disappeared from my life.

16:10.853 --> 16:14.482
I tried to kill you from inside my heart.

16:15.524 --> 16:19.426
I thought of erasing your existence from inside me.

16:20.596 --> 16:22.223
But I couldn't do it.

16:23.632 --> 16:25.099
So I thought...

16:27.336 --> 16:29.804
...that I wanted to be killed by you.

16:29.872 --> 16:33.774
Even if you forgot that you killed me soon afterwards...

16:33.843 --> 16:37.074
Even if I was one of the cherry tree's many victims...

16:37.146 --> 16:38.477
At least by your hands...

16:39.515 --> 16:42.951
If you knew of Hokuto's spell, why...

16:43.018 --> 16:43.985
Why?

16:45.020 --> 16:49.980
If you think about it, you could never commit to killing someone.

16:51.427 --> 16:52.553
You're...

16:53.629 --> 16:55.153
You truly are...

16:57.500 --> 16:58.831
...a kind person.

17:00.202 --> 17:01.726
Subaru...

17:01.804 --> 17:02.771
You know...

17:03.739 --> 17:04.865
I...

17:20.356 --> 17:22.517
You never...

17:23.726 --> 17:28.720
...say words that I expect to hear from you, do you...

17:46.448 --> 17:48.939
The future does not change.

17:52.655 --> 17:55.385
It looks like the Dragon of Heaven dreamseer...

17:55.457 --> 17:58.915
...will kill the Seven Seals even if I leave them alone.

18:09.205 --> 18:10.331
Subaru...

18:15.444 --> 18:18.845
Subaru, you wanted to be there, right?

18:18.914 --> 18:20.245
At his side.

18:21.951 --> 18:25.216
Just like I thought it would be okay for Fuma to kill me.

18:27.423 --> 18:30.221
In the past, he had almost killed me.

18:32.328 --> 18:34.762
But he didn't kill me.

18:36.465 --> 18:39.696
Since then, I think he knew my whereabouts.

18:42.404 --> 18:45.862
This is the sign that I'm the Sakurazukamori's prey.

18:46.909 --> 18:49.241
I'm sure he knew where I was...

18:49.311 --> 18:51.541
...but why didn't he come kill me?

18:52.915 --> 18:57.181
I thought it was because I wasn't worth killing.

18:58.387 --> 19:00.548
So I wanted to become stronger.

19:00.623 --> 19:04.354
Just enough so that he'd think of me as a nuisance.

19:05.394 --> 19:08.192
So that he'd think I was worth killing.

19:09.465 --> 19:12.434
But even that was the wrong assumption.

19:14.370 --> 19:16.304
What people say before death...

19:16.372 --> 19:17.532
Is it truth?

19:18.674 --> 19:19.698
Or...

19:20.743 --> 19:22.938
I don't know anymore.

19:23.012 --> 19:24.877
There's no way for me to ask.

19:24.947 --> 19:26.039
Subaru...

19:27.082 --> 19:30.108
Kamui, you don't need to worry.

19:30.185 --> 19:33.746
Just think about fulfilling your own wish.

19:34.790 --> 19:38.055
Even if my wish is someone else's misfortune?

19:40.129 --> 19:43.621
There's no way that everyone can be happy.

19:51.173 --> 19:52.606
Hokuto...

19:52.675 --> 19:55.200
The future you believed in didn't come.

19:56.312 --> 19:59.713
I knew this would happen, but I couldn't do anything.

20:02.017 --> 20:03.644
Hokuto's younger brother?

20:04.987 --> 20:07.148
The Barriers of the Dragons of Heaven...

20:07.222 --> 20:10.658
...are created to protect those they wish to protect.

20:10.726 --> 20:14.059
They're useless if there's nothing for them to protect.

20:14.129 --> 20:16.097
The Barrier Field has been broken.

20:16.165 --> 20:18.190
What's left is just an empty shell.

20:20.636 --> 20:22.831
A Dragon of Earth has died.

20:22.905 --> 20:26.705
But one of the Seven Seals has also died.
